# Backend Technical Documentation

## Khor Beauty Aesthetics Website

---

# 1. Backend Overview

The backend system is designed to support the operational and business logic of the Khor Beauty Aesthetics website.

The backend is responsible for:

* Appointment booking management
* Customer inquiry handling
* Service management
* CRM-ready customer data handling
* API communication with frontend
* Future payment integration
* WhatsApp and email automation support

The backend architecture follows a scalable service-oriented structure suitable for future SaaS-level expansion.

